Xray-core routing engine with web UI manager

Native OPNsense MVC plugin for the stock xray-core binary. Nodes
(structured credentials + share-link import), subscriptions, inbounds
and fine-grained routing rules are managed from the UI; config and the
rc.d service use dedicated names (/usr/local/etc/xray-os/, xray_os) so
nothing clashes with the official xray package.

WWW: https://github.com/nxovaeng/nxova-opn-repo
